// §14 entry 10 -- laundering a capability through a CORRECTLY polymorphic
// HOF -> EXS-E0421.
//
// §4.2, verbatim (this fixture is that example): `applica` itself is
// written correctly -- it declares `poscit alloc, sicut f`, so its row
// travels with whatever function value is actually passed in, exactly as
// the substitution rule requires. The violation is at the CALL SITE,
// `exterior`: it forwards `nocens` (which needs `rete`) into `applica`
// while itself declaring only `poscit alloc`. §4.2: "Putting the row in the
// type removes the lookup: an escaped closure carries its captured
// authority in its own type, where a caller and the audit can both see
// it" -- `exterior` is exactly the caller failing to see it.
//
// Distinct from entry 9: there the HOF itself never declared `sicut f` at
// all. Here `applica` is the worked example of a HOF written CORRECTLY,
// and the suite's own charter is explicit that "one firing does not excuse
// the other" -- this fixture and entry09's are independent checks of the
// same code, from opposite ends of the call.
//
// RUNS since b86b080 (2026-09-25). Before it, exsc emitted {EXS-E0303,
// EXS-E0421} here: the call-site argument compare read function types by
// id, rows included, and did not know that a parameter named by the
// callee's own `sicut f` accepts an argument of any row (checker.md 2.1,
// rule 3 -- stated, not implemented). b86b080 implements it; entry 9's
// bare-parameter case is still EXS-E0303, pinned beside this one in
// tests/unit/chk_ty_sicut_row.asm. The `;` after each `redde` was a
// fixture defect (spec 8.6 requires it) and is fixed here. Measured on the
// main tree at fe24fe5 with `exsc aedifica --hospes x86_64-linux
// --diagnostica json`: exactly {EXS-E0421}, exit 1.

publica functio applica(v: f32, f: functio(f32) -> f32) -> f32 poscit alloc, sicut f {
    redde f(v);
}

publica functio nocens(x: f32) -> f32 poscit rete {
    redde x;
}

publica functio exterior(v: f32) -> f32 poscit alloc {
    redde applica(v, nocens);
}

// TEST: entry=10 shape=code expect-code=EXS-E0421 status=run
